    "description": {
      "content": "Apidog provides a public REST API that lets developers programmatically interact with Apidog projects for importing and exporting API specifications. All API URLs begin with the base URL https://api.apidog.com. The API is versioned via the `X-Apidog-Api-Version` request header (current version: `2024-03-28`). Authentication uses a personal API access token passed as a Bearer Token in the `Authorization` header.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Apidog",
